{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1353760-can-time-manipulating-aberrants-permenently-alter-peoples-ages-2nd-edition","id":1353760,"title":"Can Time manipulating Aberrants permenently alter peoples' ages? (2nd Edition)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-12-09T04:34:18-08:00","id":1353760,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Can Time manipulating Aberrants permenently alter peoples' ages? (2nd Edition)","content":"In 1st Edition, Aberrants with Temporal Manipulation could use a Technique called Age Alteration to permanently alter the age on a person.<br /> <br /> I have a PC with that 1st Edition Power &amp; Technique, &amp; I am curious if she can be converted to 2nd Edition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-09T06:23:43-08:00","id":1353793,"title":"","content":"Yes. The effect of aging is a condition, if you treat it as an injury condition, add the proper tag and the target is not a nova it can be permanent (at least only treatable with nova powers, or psi if it\u2019s available)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-10T08:22:54-08:00","id":1354155,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1353760-can-time-manipulating-aberrants-permenently-alter-peoples-ages-2nd-edition?p=1353793#post1353793\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes. The effect of aging is a condition, if you treat it as an injury condition, add the proper tag and the target is not a nova it can be permanent (at least only treatable with nova powers, or psi if it\u2019s available)</div> </div> </div> </div>Of course in 1ed that power could make people/objects older or younger. Really the Time Manipulation power I miss most is the 1ed take on Time Stop. The current one is indistinguishable in effect from any other Entangle/paralysis power. The 1ed take made whatever it affect not only incapable of any thought or action, it also made them immoveable, indestructible and immune to everything while it was in affect. I remember using it in conjunction with a large bath towel to run across wide gaps between buildings (freeze the towel and run across it), using as a bullet/laser/disintegration-proof shield and other fun stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}